# Mux local commit message file.
# `.git_msg` is OPTIONAL. It is a local, developer-specific scratch file used to
# draft a commit message before running `git commit`; it is never required by the
# build, CI, or any tooling. If you do not use it, simply ignore this entry.
# Format (when used): plain UTF-8 text, first line = commit subject, blank line,
# then the body. Do not commit it and do not put secrets or tokens in it.
.git_msg
